  },
  "_type": "post",
  "_updatedAt": "2026-06-27T12:15:33Z",
  "body": [
    {
      "_key": "e884c91d3f51",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "67a9b2391d8c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "TL;DR:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "110d8e104aec",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " The best AI meeting notes do not start with AI. They start with your rough bullet points, guided by your judgment, then enhanced by AI using the full transcript. The four-step workflow here takes under five minutes to set up, works across Zoom, Google Meet, Teams, and any other platform, and never announces a recording to the room. Because Granola captures device audio without joining as a visible participant, you stay focused on the conversation and leave with structured notes your team can act on."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "blockquote"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2844e431e133",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "e8fc9cfdbfd2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Most people in back-to-back meetings obsess over staying present but lose the strategic details because generic AI summaries miss the point. The typical automated note-taker automates everything, highlights nothing, and joins your call as a visible participant that changes how people speak and what they share. This guide breaks down the exact workflow for capturing meetings discreetly and turning messy thoughts into structured records your team can actually use."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "3ff0fd93cf35",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0c6d1f43d4ed",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The 4-step workflow for AI meeting notes"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "6bb80457bf03",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "2baa2e53c401",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The "
        },
        {
          "_key": "c9f0d94fab07",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "0f31b8f710bc"
          ],
          "text": "AI meeting notes"
        },
        {
          "_key": "40710d9407ba",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " workflow that actually works is not the one where AI does everything. It is the one where you jot what matters and AI fills in the rest. Here is how it runs in practice with Granola, which operates as a bot-free desktop app for people in back-to-back meetings."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "0f31b8f710bc",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.granola.ai/ai-meeting-assistant"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "72e159a19d5a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d38166632b8f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Meet Granola, the AI notepad for back-to-back meetings."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "787d9337a32c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "77138ac72794",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Step 1: Connect your calendar"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "14e62ba032c2",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "6333436260f3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Download the Granola app for Mac or Windows, connect your Google or Microsoft calendar, and grant audio permissions. Setup takes under five minutes because the onboarding cuts every step that does not need to exist. Once you connect, Granola syncs your calendar and sends you a reminder one minute before any scheduled call with two or more attendees."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "1b5186d9aec9",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "f0caf6531736",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "No training required. The app stays out of your way until you need it."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "b1c915ce0f4d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "561874b8fae6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\"Easy to set up and runs quietly in the background. Accurate discussion summaries with the backup transcript available.\" - "
        },
        {
          "_key": "f202dddcbc34",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "baff06d472ac"
          ],
          "text": "Joe M. on G2"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "baff06d472ac",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.g2.com/products/granola/reviews/granola-review-11055567"
        }
      ],
      "style": "blockquote"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c0093deee307",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "f63699464702",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Step 2: Jot rough notes during meetings"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "f90e8ba4349d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "9f747e978e33",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "During the meeting, type anything or nothing into the notepad window. The human-in-the-loop approach is Granola's "
        },
        {
          "_key": "b3b57272f498",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "9a50f9a4abbf"
          ],
          "text": "core mechanic for AI-enhanced notes"
        },
        {
          "_key": "7ef4c98754e2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ": Your notes guide the AI rather than the other way around. Write \"pricing concerns\" and Granola finds every pricing discussion in the transcript and adds relevant quotes. Write nothing, and you get a generic summary. Write focused bullets, and you get focused enhancement."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "9a50f9a4abbf",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://docs.granola.ai/help-center/taking-notes/ai-enhanced-notes"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0f193c0ca2ea",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "2e3111cca14d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "This means you stay present in the conversation. You read body language, ask follow-up questions, and listen for strategic nuance that a transcript alone cannot capture."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "f32fd252b973",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "6503553a9e2b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\"I can keep taking my own notes, and I never have to worry about missing anything important.\" - "
        },
        {
          "_key": "d1cff618f6d0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "feb306de33d6"
          ],
          "text": "Verified user on G2"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "feb306de33d6",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://g2.com/products/granola/reviews/granola-review-12594807"
        }
      ],
      "style": "blockquote"
    },
    {
      "_key": "88f16a039304",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a0aae46ca85e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "You can also use "
        },
        {
          "_key": "3e1648748858",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "f81cfc8491e0"
          ],
          "text": "Granola's 29+ meeting templates"
        },
        {
          "_key": "15fa5c0457a2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " to pre-structure notes for specific meeting types: Sales calls, 1-on-1s, investor pitches, and customer research sessions."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "f81cfc8491e0",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://docs.granola.ai/help-center/taking-notes/customise-notes-with-templates"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2f40e60f7a35",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d1317b6fad6c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Step 3: Let AI enhance your notes"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "479e05878223",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "3eed6dfb81ed",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "When the meeting ends, click \"Enhance notes.\" In seconds, Granola merges your rough bullets with context from the full transcript. As the "
        },
        {
          "_key": "9e0bd45e4e9e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "331426763249"
          ],
          "text": "AI-enhanced notes documentation"
        },
        {
          "_key": "8192ce1d02ad",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " explains, your notes stay in black text, and AI additions appear in gray, so you always know what you wrote versus what the AI added."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "331426763249",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://help.granola.ai/article/ai-enhanced-notes"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "11663ec4db86",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "17a445c9fd21",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "If you want to verify a specific detail after the meeting, ask Granola Chat directly and double-click the inline citation to surface the exact transcript excerpt behind it. This is especially useful for checking client commitments, financial figures, and timeline agreements."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "cd67b1f35f92",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "26b35a3e623f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\"Granola nails exactly what I need: clean, reliable meeting transcripts and smart follow-up summaries without any fluff. I use it for nearly every call to stay focused on the conversation instead of scribbling notes. The follow-up action items are especially useful. Huge time saver.\" - "
        },
        {
          "_key": "c1f98c1c1af8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "ae3529b90062"
          ],
          "text": "Verified user on G2"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "ae3529b90062",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://g2.com/products/granola/reviews/granola-review-11289286"
        }
      ],
      "style": "blockquote"
    },
    {
      "_key": "b4abf6d0b4bc",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "cccf93e7f3b2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Step 4: Edit and share"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "9ba03b0f8bab",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ce146004365e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "After enhancing your notes, review the gray-text AI additions against your own black-text bullets before sharing anything. The review takes under a minute and is the step that separates useful documentation from a raw transcript dump. Once you are satisfied, you can:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2df2f4abcd79",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "e11e27a81628",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Copy a shareable link and send it directly to attendees."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "636e42e20fd6",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b8b083dfccd7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Add the note to a shared team folder so collaborators can access the full timeline."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "02ac7d4aabf8",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "7d2fe37d27ad",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Chat with the transcript, or export the content into your existing workflow via integrations with HubSpot, Notion, Slack, Attio, and Zapier."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "90d201c6e757",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ad00e73175fe",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Notes are private by default and are never shared with meeting participants unless you take one of these steps."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2667ca2829c5",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "7c48462650c7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Quick-start checklist:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "374adeab18d1",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0bbf3eaf068e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Download Granola for Mac or Windows"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "9f1a9d7eadf7",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "1e3cab993e5c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Connect your Google or Microsoft calendar"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "33ef8c1a78f8",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "1202dc14a67e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Grant microphone and system audio permissions"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e334065fc100",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "3a6c138a31e7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Open the notepad one minute before your first meeting"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "12da4706f2f5",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ebde68509f7e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Jot rough notes during the call"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "72abbe954186",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c9ea5d9e60a8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Click \"Enhance notes\" when the meeting ends"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "9a9430263a43",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0c8757907e53",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Review, edit, and share"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "849f147fb0c2",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "106b44a4aa06",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "System audio vs bot recording: What's the difference?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "5391e850bb03",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "7cb3a09ace18",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The method your AI notepad uses to capture a meeting has a bigger impact on your conversations than most people realize. The "
        },
        {
          "_key": "eacaa77817d5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "c48c2ca9d4cb"
          ],
          "text": "AI notetaker privacy guide"
        },
        {
          "_key": "32bb5756ff5c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " covers this in detail."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "c48c2ca9d4cb",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://granola.ai/blog/ai-notetaker-participant-privacy-consent"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "500ccf95d588",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "8645d79156f0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "How bot-based recording works"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "f4f8500ea742",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "45ba53264294",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Bot-based recorders deploy a virtual participant that joins your call through the conferencing platform's API. The bot appears in the participant list, is visible to all attendees, and typically triggers a \"this meeting is being recorded\" announcement. The audio is then uploaded to external servers for transcription and storage."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e0b50c5991e8",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c2638f0b2a09",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "How system audio capture works"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "1bc7c4d722ec",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "272d023795f8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "System audio capture tools access your computer's microphone and audio output directly, with no bot joining the call as a participant. Granola captures device audio locally, transcribes it in real time, and immediately deletes the audio file. It stores no audio recordings anywhere, as "
        },
        {
          "_key": "60c59f71bb4a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "57a1cfd48249"
          ],
          "text": "Granola's security documentation"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ff9c3f7b80f6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " confirms. Granola achieved "
        },
        {
          "_key": "972fb05dd7d3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "f004715ded74"
          ],
          "text": "SOC 2 Type 2 certification"
        },
        {
          "_key": "75a6c0cd1436",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " in July 2025, completing the audit in three months rather than the typical 12-18 because less sensitive data means fewer controls to audit. Granola is also GDPR compliant, with third-party AI providers contractually prohibited from training on your meeting data."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "57a1cfd48249",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.granola.ai/security"
        },
        {
          "_key": "f004715ded74",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://granola.ai/updates/granola-is-soc2-type-2-compliant"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "30b901a03614",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "6a3190ca3db3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "This architecture works with any meeting platform, including Zoom, Google Meet, Teams, Slack huddles, FaceTime, and even in-person conversations, as the "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ab7b5b2916d7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "5b5e1f526f2b"
          ],
          "text": "Google Meet integration overview"
        },
        {
          "_key": "3e3a07d0f8bc",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " explains."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "5b5e1f526f2b",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://granola.ai/blog/granola-google-meet-integration-recording-transcription"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "612dd4863a95",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0e05a749ebc4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\"It listens directly from my device audio, no bots joining calls, and produces clean, structured summaries with decisions, action items, and key points. That alone makes it far more seamless than tools like Otter.ai or Fireflies, which often feel intrusive because they require a bot to join the meeting.\" - "
        },
        {
          "_key": "eb5eb565e28a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "163dacff3960"
          ],
          "text": "Brahmatheja Reddy M. on G2"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "163dacff3960",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.g2.com/products/granola/reviews/granola-review-11932118"
        }
      ],
      "style": "blockquote"
    },
    {
      "_key": "5c3d457b3889",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "3a6f8fcce96e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The rough notes in, structured output out pattern"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a854e8c2fc37",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "e78b7d730fbb",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "This pattern separates useful AI meeting notes from generic transcript dumps. It is also what makes the "
        },
        {
          "_key": "62eaba6d16d8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "34875740f87a"
          ],
          "text": "automated meeting summaries workflow"
        },
        {
          "_key": "f25b241bc604",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " actually reflect the strategic intent of the room rather than just the volume of words spoken."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "34875740f87a",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://granola.ai/blog/automated-meeting-summaries"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "f89e620ed771",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "4dc333e0c5d1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Why rough notes work better than full transcripts"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e9dfea4193f9",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a153a9ff38c2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A full transcript captures everything equally. The CFO's offhand comment gets the same weight as the decision that changes your roadmap. Your rough notes do not. When you type \"budget concerns raised, revisit in June\" during a meeting, you make a judgment call about what matters. That judgment is exactly what the AI needs to prioritize, and it prevents the output from being a 12-paragraph summary where the key decision is buried in paragraph eight."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "1e71b73892a1",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00e1a63ebf4b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "fede7b2957dc"
          ],
          "text": "Chatting with your meetings in Granola"
        },
        {
          "_key": "6e18f83078ec",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " extends this further: You can ask \"What were their three main concerns?\" immediately after the call and get an answer sourced from the live transcript, with inline citations you can double-click to verify."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "fede7b2957dc",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://docs.granola.ai/help-center/getting-more-from-your-notes/chatting-with-your-meetings"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "16fd75452638",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "cf15f8e0a0e5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "How AI turns messy bullets into structure"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "46473d615e01",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "42efa2fe0837",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "When you click \"Enhance notes,\" Granola analyzes the full transcript using your bullets as anchors. Each bullet you wrote becomes a heading or a priority signal. The AI finds all transcript content relevant to that topic, synthesizes it into prose, and adds it beneath your note in gray text. You wrote the structure. The AI filled in the supporting detail."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2d5fecee0ebb",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "9cbef5941366",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\"I love that I can use Granola for absolutely everything... The notes it generates are incredibly helpful on their own, but the real magic is the follow-up discussion in the chat.\" - "
        },
        {
          "_key": "e5bb42625c4f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "78fdb67eab5a"
          ],
          "text": "Christel C. on G2"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "78fdb67eab5a",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.g2.com/products/granola/reviews/granola-review-12589742"
        }
      ],
      "style": "blockquote"
    },
    {
      "_key": "43229f47bdaa",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b450a034a710",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Live example: Messy bullets becoming structured notes"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "653f3ee35a1b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "bb3990b89708",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Here is a realistic before-and-after for a founder running a product roadmap session with enterprise customers."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "bac6b2f0b0cd",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "923d0e22b146",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Before"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "fc9b445d2488",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "8038ae283a6f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "budget concerns enterprise"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "7280dd266dcb",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c7414abfc6cb",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Q3 timeline still unclear"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "4809308e8819",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "78915bae4175",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "competitor mentioned feature parity"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "8781ec9b2318",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "06528483143c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "follow up product team"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "d6cad6be6ea0",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "03eff4cf558b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "After"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "262a7f1ed00e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "e13e28af1f9e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Budget concerns (enterprise) Customer raised concerns about pricing for large seat deployments and requested tiered discounts. Mentioned an upcoming budget review cycle. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "0ce7f07cf6c9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "em"
          ],
          "text": "(AI added context from transcript)"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "9f5190bd7ef3",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "28bc65976b87",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Q3 launch timeline Team aligned on a phased rollout with alpha, beta, and general availability milestones. Marketing team needs assets confirmed before the beta stage. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "9e8acaf12109",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "em"
          ],
          "text": "(Extracted from discussion)"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "1da367e81e0f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "8ac1e79ffa32",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Competitive positioning Customer referenced a competitor's forecasting feature. Team noted real-time data sync as the key differentiator. Recommend emphasizing in next sales deck. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "d616f40edf85",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "em"
          ],
          "text": "(AI synthesized from transcript mentions)"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c6bbc6203ce9",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "94d3fcdef19c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Action items"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "74917c916b0d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "11f1e0ba87e4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Product team to validate data sync benchmarks."
        }
      ],
      "level": 2,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "be521b720e55",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d882957cdd5a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Marketing to confirm asset production timeline."
        }
      ],
      "level": 2,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0b386fa3791a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ea9b08f8b9d1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "What changed and why it matters"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "9f1c315001fd",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "1878496493a4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Four vague bullets became a structured record with context, competitive intelligence, and clear ownership. Because you guided the AI with your rough bullets, the output reflects your strategic read of the conversation rather than just word frequency. That is the difference between notes you share with confidence and a transcript you have to heavily edit first."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "4327f52f6a9b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "11c097887031",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "What good AI meeting notes look like"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "250eb18e2d5c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "66af3dce677b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Quality AI meeting documentation has four components that separate it from a transcript or a generic summary."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "258b9ce5a478",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "811e821df932",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Clear decisions with context:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "d682a4abfcc1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Each decision should include what was decided, who weighed in, and what alternatives were considered. \"We agreed to delay the launch\" is less useful than \"We agreed to delay the launch to September based on engineering capacity concerns raised by the head of product.\""
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "90a482f659d6",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "f00db8263054",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Action items with owners:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "99ef253035f9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Clean summaries often fail because action items lack three elements: A specific deliverable, a single accountable person, and a hard deadline. Good AI notes capture all three."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "20829a364f86",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "450604d2cc0b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Deadlines and follow-up dates:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "a1d7ad026dcc",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Dates mentioned in conversation should appear in the notes explicitly. If a customer says \"let's revisit after our board meeting in June,\" that date belongs in your record, not just in your memory."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "52e7954364f8",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "3d8352f058d4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Key discussion points preserved:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "fe9bbf9d7de8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " The concerns raised, the objections surfaced, and the open questions left unanswered are often more valuable than the decisions themselves. They become the agenda for the next meeting and tell you what to watch for."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "f2e8033aac12",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ef2d0cfea145",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\"I find Granola incredibly helpful and intuitive for taking notes in meetings. The note summaries Granola creates are also a standout, making it easy to get concise or detailed notes as needed.\" - "
        },
        {
          "_key": "e25a6d9ae32b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "e7c12e48b5f3"
          ],
          "text": "Catherine S. on G2"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "e7c12e48b5f3",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.g2.com/products/granola/reviews/granola-review-11755500"
        }
      ],
      "style": "blockquote"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a017ee170edf",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "efab72c445a2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Common pitfalls to avoid"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "61aeace42340",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "9e58485d813a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Sharing notes before reviewing them"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "7a46b50406da",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "f3c948657828",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Fully automated AI summaries can misweight context, pulling from small talk at the start of a call or treating a tentative comment as a firm commitment. Granola's gray-text layer addresses this directly: Your own notes appear in black and AI additions appear in gray, so every enhancement is visible and auditable before you share anything. The review step takes under a minute. Share a draft, never a raw enhancement."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "820749ae86ee",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "cda4b7749140",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Missing context that AI can't capture"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "3ff721998722",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "5c7d8238f3d5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Tone, hesitation, and body language do not appear in transcripts. When a customer says \"that's interesting\" while looking away from the camera, a transcript reads it as enthusiasm. Your rough note during the meeting, if it says \"seemed skeptical,\" changes everything about how the AI-enhanced output reads and how you follow up."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "33ab46ac1932",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "06de73df157e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Try Granola for free: "
        },
        {
          "_key": "8ad88ab100fb",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "76d3a621c423"
          ],
          "text": "Download the Mac or Windows app"
        },
        {
          "_key": "d79078c05629",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", connect your calendar, and capture your next meeting bot-free to see the rough notes in, structured output out pattern in action."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "76d3a621c423",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://granola.ai"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "b263e518bdcf",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "070d24f697c0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "FAQs"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "7a6cd7d6aa67",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "7ca0393a89fc",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Does Granola store the audio from meetings?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c58f8ceff562",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "9a4359850839",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Granola captures device audio, transcribes it in real time, and immediately deletes the audio file, as confirmed in Granola's security documentation."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "af1c84e15b9a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "37d5b8187e6e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Who can see my notes?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "b3d7f50c030e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "f36b5e4e4002",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "As a user, you control who sees your notes. Notes are private by default, until you choose to share them with others."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "322d55dccc60",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "e38373c85ee9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Does Granola work with any meeting platform?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "992a547b450e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "58d6614b6c66",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Granola for Desktop works with any meeting platform. Zoom, Meet, Teams, you name it. Granola for iPhone is built for in-person meetings."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "761c0a428265",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "987868f6b53d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Key terms"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e6ddd7a38ea3",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d44cf38216c1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Human-in-the-loop notes:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "d196832fa56e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " A note-taking approach where you write rough bullets during a meeting to guide AI enhancement, rather than relying on fully automated summaries. Your judgment filters what matters before AI fills in supporting detail."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c5cdfccec766",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b16a00dbe3d0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Enhanced notes:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "698ee454118b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " The output generated when Granola merges your rough meeting bullets with context from the full transcript. Your original notes appear in black text and AI additions appear in gray, so you control what stays."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "916c260ae47a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "865697ab464a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "SOC 2 Type 2 compliance:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "c9173a7580af",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " A security certification that verifies a company's controls for protecting customer data meet industry standards over an audit period. Granola achieved this certification in July 2025, completing the audit in three months rather than the typical 12-18."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    }
  ],
  "hidden": true,
  "isFeatured": false,
  "publishedAt": "2026-06-12",
  "slug": {
    "_type": "slug",
